890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-06-27T16:28:07Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T12:08:27Z","closed_at":"2026-09-29T19:11:39Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120695","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120695","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120695.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120695.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-29T19:11:39Z"},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nCtrl/Cmd toggles grid snapping in the 3D editor while held during object manipulation. In certain situations the toggle gets stuck (the key is treated as held even after it is released) until any key press refreshes the state.\r\n\r\n- Closes #115616\r\n- Closes #115368 \r\n- Closes #59687 \r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe root cause is that the snap key state was cached and updated in `Node3DEditor::shortcut_input`, which was not called for the key release event in some cases. Cases I've tested:\r\n- [macOS] **Cmd+Tab out of Godot:** if you hold Cmd+Tab until the macOS animations finish, the Cmd release doesn't reach Godot\r\n- [macOS/Windows] **Ctrl/Cmd+S to save and releasing Ctrl/Cmd while the save progress dialog is up:** input events aren't forwarded to Godot windows while the save is in progress.\r\n- [macOS/Windows] **Holding Ctrl/Cmd, opening project settings, releasing Ctrl/Cmd:** the release event is sent to the project settings window, never reaching `Node3DEditor`\r\n\r\nThe solution is to query the Ctrl/Cmd state directly from `Input` (which appears to always have the correct pressed state). `CanvasItemEditor` already does the same for snapping, so this looks like the correct approach. I also checked the original PR that implemented snapping with Ctrl/Cmd #16890 - there was no specific reason to cache the value.\r\n\r\nℹ️ I have tested the changes on macOS and on Windows 11 (via Parallels).\r\n\r\n_AI assistance was used for codebase exploration, code reviewing and stylistic text editing. No generated code was used in the PR_","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120695/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120695/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}